rdkit provides CMake targets:

    find_package(rdkit CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE RDKit::GraphMol RDKit::SmilesParse RDKit::FileParsers RDKit::RDGeneral)

The namespace is RDKit::. Library target names match the upstream CMake targets
(GraphMol, SmilesParse, FileParsers, Depictor, MolDraw2D, ...).

Runtime data files are installed under share/rdkit/Data. Set the RDBASE
environment variable to the share/rdkit directory if RDKit looks for them at
runtime.
